---
layout: base.njk
title: "Blog"
description: "Actualités, méthode et conseils pour les relations médias."
---
<section class="blog-list wrap">
  <div class="blog-list-head">
    <div class="eyebrow">Le blog Assistant-RP</div>
    <h1>Ce qu’on apprend<br><em>en fabriquant l’atelier.</em></h1>
  </div>

  {% set posts = collections.post | reverse %}
  {% if posts.length %}
  <div class="blog-grid">
    {% for post in posts %}
    <a class="blog-card" href="{{ post.url }}">
      {% if post.data.cover %}
        <img src="{{ post.data.cover }}" alt="">
      {% else %}
        <span class="blog-card-noimg" aria-hidden="true"></span>
      {% endif %}
      <div class="blog-card-body">
        <span class="blog-card-date">{{ post.data.date | readableDate }}</span>
        <h2>{{ post.data.title }}</h2>
        <p>{{ post.data.excerpt }}</p>
      </div>
    </a>
    {% endfor %}
  </div>
  {% else %}
  <p class="blog-empty">Premier article en préparation — revenez bientôt.</p>
  {% endif %}
</section>
